# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOASYS-Vault — Audiobooks ignore list (template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Silences warnings you've decided to live with. Copy to
# ignored/<drive>/audiobooks.yaml (e.g. ignored/server/audiobooks.yaml),
# uncomment what you need, and re-run. The real file is gitignored.
#
# Names match exactly at their level, in any category, case-insensitively. An
# entry silences EVERY warning at or below it — scan, validate and Plex. To turn
# off one kind of warning everywhere, use `checks:` in rules/audiobooks.yaml.
#
# Full reference: docs/CONFIG.md → "ignored/<drive>/<type>.yaml"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# A whole category folder
# folders:
#   - Other Audible

# A whole author — multi-author folders use the folder's comma-joined name
# authors:
#   - Don Malarkey, Bob Welch

# One book — bare, or with its author
# books:
#   - The Lord of the Rings
#   - J.R.R. Tolkien/The Hobbit

# One chapter file — must name its book
# chapters:
#   - The Lord of the Rings/09 - Chapter 9.mp3
